{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【宏福苑大火一周年】</p><p>2026年11月26日，宏福苑大火一周年，有市民到場獻花悼念死難者，希望遺屬可以走出傷痛，多個宗教團體亦有相關追悼儀式。李家超聯同官員探訪居民，稱政府將修例堵塞樓宇維修漏洞。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208671-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E7%A8%B1%E7%82%BA%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E5%90%84%E7%95%8C%E5%BF%83%E6%84%8F%E6%9C%83%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E5%B0%87%E8%8A%B1%E6%9D%9F%E7%AD%89%E7%A7%BB%E8%87%B3%E5%AE%97%E6%95%99%E5%A0%B4%E6%89%80%E5%AD%98%E6%94%BE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢政府稱會逐步將花束等移至宗教場所存放</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208673-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E4%BF%A1%E7%9C%BE%E5%8F%83%E8%88%87%E5%BD%8C%E6%92%92%E7%82%BA%E7%81%BD%E6%B0%91%E7%A5%88%E7%A6%B1%E8%93%AC%E7%80%9B%E4%BB%99%E9%A4%A8%E8%A8%AD%E8%BF%BD%E6%80%9D%E9%81%93%E5%A0%B4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢多個宗教團體亦有相關追悼儀式</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208604-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E4%BA%8B%E5%BE%8C%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%8F%90%E5%BC%B7%E5%8C%96%E6%B6%88%E9%98%B2%E6%8E%AA%E6%96%BD13%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%AF%A9%E8%A8%88%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E9%A1%9E%E4%BC%BC%E5%BB%BA%E8%AD%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢13年前審計報告已有類似建議強化消防措施</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208441-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E8%81%AF%E5%90%8C%E5%AE%98%E5%93%A1%E6%8E%A2%E8%A8%AA%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E7%A8%B1%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%B0%87%E4%BF%AE%E4%BE%8B%E5%A0%B5%E5%A1%9E%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢李家超聯同官員探訪居民稱政府將修例堵塞樓宇維修漏洞</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208422-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E5%B1%8B%E8%8B%91%E8%8A%B1%E7%B4%84%E5%8D%83%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E9%98%B2%E7%81%AB%E6%95%88%E8%83%BD%E8%A8%AD%E6%B3%95%E6%87%89%E5%B0%8D%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%B8%E7%85%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢有大維修屋苑花約千萬元提升防火效能</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208109-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E9%99%B3%E5%9C%8B%E5%9F%BA%E6%96%99%E7%B4%8450%E5%90%8D%E5%85%AC%E5%8B%99%E5%93%A1%E9%9C%80%E5%8F%97%E6%9F%A5%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E7%82%BA%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%BB%E5%8F%8A%E7%BD%B9%E9%9B%A3%E8%80%85%E5%AE%B6%E5%B1%AC%E5%A2%9E%E5%85%A9%E9%A0%85%E8%A3%9C%E5%8A%A9%E9%87%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢政府為業主及罹難者家屬增兩項補助金</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208423-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E7%81%BD%E6%B0%91%E6%80%95%E5%86%8D%E8%A6%8B%E6%A3%9A%E7%B6%B2%E6%95%85%E8%B2%B7%E6%9D%91%E5%B1%8B%E5%8F%AA%E6%83%B3%E5%AE%89%E5%B1%85%E6%A8%82%E6%A5%AD%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%B6%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%A3%E5%88%86%E4%BD%8F%E5%85%A9%E9%96%93%E9%81%8E%E6%B8%A1%E5%B1%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢災民怕再見棚網故買村屋：只想安居樂業</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208172-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E5%B9%B3%E7%81%AB%E7%81%BD%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E7%9B%B8%E4%BF%A1%E7%89%B9%E5%8D%80%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%88%AE%E9%AA%A8%E7%99%82%E5%82%B7%E6%8E%A8%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢港澳平：相信特區政府刮骨療傷推改革</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207551-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E6%98%9F%E6%9C%9F%E6%97%A5%E6%AA%94%E6%A1%88%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%AB%E6%8F%AD%E5%90%B8%E7%85%99%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%9C%B0%E7%9B%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E7%A6%81%E7%85%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢星期日檔案｜宏福苑大火揭吸煙監管漏洞　地盤全面禁煙</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【兩電明年加價】</p><p></p><p>兩電公布來年電費調整，中電及港燈分別上調百分之1.8及7.9，元旦起生效。有港島居民及商戶認為，港島電費加幅大，擔心成本大增。有學者就指，兩電電費未來繼續上調是趨勢。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208191-%E5%85%A9%E9%9B%BB%E9%9B%BB%E8%B2%BB%E5%88%86%E5%88%A5%E4%B8%8A%E8%AA%BF18%E5%8F%8A79%E5%85%83%E6%97%A6%E8%B5%B7%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢兩電電費分別上調1.8%及7.9%　元旦起生效</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208225-%E5%85%A9%E9%9B%BB%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E5%B7%B2%E5%8B%95%E7%94%A8%E9%9B%BB%E8%B2%BB%E7%A9%A9%E5%AE%9A%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91%E7%94%A8%E7%9B%A1%E7%87%83%E6%96%99%E5%B8%B3%E9%A4%98%E6%AC%BE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢兩電強調已動用電費穩定基金及用盡燃料帳餘款</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208236-%E5%AD%B8%E8%80%85%E6%8C%87%E5%85%A9%E9%9B%BB%E9%9B%BB%E8%B2%BB%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E7%BA%8C%E4%B8%8A%E8%AA%BF%E5%B1%AC%E8%B6%A8%E5%8B%A2%E5%8C%97%E8%A7%92%E6%9C%89%E5%95%86%E9%8B%AA%E7%87%9F%E9%81%8B%E5%A3%93%E5%8A%9B%E5%A4%A7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢學者指兩電電費未來續上調屬趨勢</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【特區護照缺頁案】</p><p>有市民聲稱特區護照出現缺頁，被日本拒絕入境，入境處就拘捕女事主及其男友，涉嫌非法改動護照，重申護照印製時無問題。有大律師指拘捕不代表能起訴，處方需提供更多證據，包括證明是他們親自破壞護照，及了解相關原因。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208821-%E7%89%B9%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E7%BC%BA%E9%A0%81%E6%A1%88%E5%A4%A7%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%AB%E6%8C%87%E6%8B%98%E6%8D%95%E4%B8%8D%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E8%83%BD%E8%B5%B7%E8%A8%B4%E8%99%95%E6%96%B9%E9%9C%80%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%E8%AD%89%E6%93%9A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢大律師指拘捕不代表能起訴</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208672-%E7%89%B9%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E7%BC%BA%E9%A0%81%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%80%E5%B0%8D%E6%83%85%E4%BE%B6%E6%B6%89%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E6%94%B9%E5%8B%95%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E5%85%A5%E5%A2%83%E8%99%95%E9%87%8D%E7%94%B3%E5%8D%B0%E8%A3%BD%E6%99%82%E7%84%A1%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢入境處重申印製時無問題</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208724-%E7%89%B9%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E7%BC%BA%E9%A0%81%E6%A1%88%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E6%90%8D%E5%A3%9E%E6%87%89%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%BE%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢延伸閱讀｜護照損壞應怎麼辦？</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【選委會選舉投票率高過上屆】</p><p></p><p>第二屆選委會界別分組選舉於2026年11月22日舉行。投票今屆31個界別有競爭，多個界別投票率達百分百，整體投票率接近九成九，比上屆高9個百分點。港澳辦和中聯辦祝賀選舉順利完成，指新一屆選舉展現高質量民主新氣象。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207968-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E8%BE%A6%E6%8C%87%E5%B1%95%E7%8F%BE%E9%AB%98%E8%B3%AA%E9%87%8F%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E6%84%9B%E5%9C%8B%E8%80%85%E6%B2%BB%E6%B8%AF%E5%8E%9F%E5%89%87%E5%BE%97%E5%88%B0%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E8%90%BD%E5%AF%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢1,500人的選舉委員會明年2月換屆</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207792-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%BE%8B%E5%B8%AB%E6%9C%83%E6%9C%83%E9%95%B7%E6%B9%AF%E6%96%87%E9%BE%8D%E8%90%BD%E9%81%B8%E6%9C%89%E7%95%B6%E9%81%B8%E4%BA%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%81%B8%E7%89%B9%E9%A6%96%E6%99%82%E6%9C%83%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%85%A8%E6%B8%AF%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢有當選人指選特首時會代表全港市民</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207832-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E8%BE%A6%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%80%E5%B1%86%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%B1%95%E7%8F%BE%E9%AB%98%E5%93%81%E8%B3%AA%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%BB%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E5%85%A8%E6%96%87\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢港澳辦：新一屆選舉展現高品質民主新氣象｜全文</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207833-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E4%B8%AD%E8%81%AF%E8%BE%A6%E5%84%AA%E4%B8%AD%E9%81%B8%E5%84%AA%E5%B1%95%E7%8F%BE%E6%96%B0%E6%B0%A3%E8%B1%A1%E9%81%B8%E8%B3%A2%E4%BB%BB%E8%83%BD%E9%96%8B%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%B1%80%E5%85%A8%E6%96%87\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢中聯辦︰優中選優展現新氣象　選賢任能開創新局｜全文</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207836-%E9%81%B8%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E7%95%B6%E9%81%B8%E4%BA%BA%E5%90%8D%E5%96%AE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢當選人名單</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【接連有公私營機構系統被黑客入侵】</p><p></p><p>接連有機構資料外洩，私隱專員公署指，人工智能(AI)令黑客更易作出攻擊。有議員就提醒，即使機構將資訊系統外判予第三方，若洩漏資料仍需負法律責任。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208610-%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%A3%E6%9C%89%E6%A9%9F%E6%A7%8B%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E5%A4%96%E6%B4%A9%E5%90%B3%E5%82%91%E8%8E%8A%E6%8C%87%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%B0%87%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB%E6%8E%A8%E5%8D%B8%E4%BA%88%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E6%89%BF%E8%BE%A6%E5%95%86\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢吳傑莊指不可將法律責任推卸予第三方承辦商</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208856-%E5%86%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%85%AC%E7%A7%81%E7%87%9F%E6%A9%9F%E6%A7%8B%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E9%81%AD%E9%BB%91%E5%AE%A2%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E6%B6%89%E5%85%AB%E9%81%94%E9%80%9A%E7%B4%843%E8%90%AC%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B6%E6%88%96%E5%95%86%E6%88%B6%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢涉八達通約3萬客戶或商戶資料</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208572-247Fitness%E6%9C%83%E5%93%A1%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E8%A2%AB%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%80%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E5%8F%97%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢24/7 Fitness會員系統被未經授權存取</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208785-AEON%E4%BF%A1%E8%B2%B8%E8%B2%A1%E5%8B%99%E4%BA%9E%E6%B4%B2%E6%8C%87%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E8%A2%AB%E9%BB%91%E5%AE%A2%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E6%9A%AB%E7%84%A1%E8%AD%89%E6%93%9A%E9%A1%AF%E7%A4%BA%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E8%A2%AB%E4%B8%8D%E7%95%B6%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢AEON信貸財務(亞洲)指系統被黑客入侵</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208478-%E5%9F%8E%E5%B8%82%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8%E7%B6%B2%E9%81%AD%E9%BB%91%E5%AE%A2%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E6%8C%87%E4%BF%A1%E7%94%A8%E5%8D%A1%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E6%9C%89%E6%A9%9F%E6%9C%83%E8%A2%AB%E7%A0%B4%E8%A7%A3%E7%B1%B2%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B6%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%AD%A6%E8%A6%BA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢城市售票網遭黑客入侵涉130萬使用者個人資料</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208214-%E6%B8%AF%E6%80%A1%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E6%89%8B%E6%A9%9F%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BC%8F%E7%96%91%E8%A2%AB%E9%BB%91%E5%AE%A2%E5%85%A5%E4%BE%B5%E9%86%AB%E8%A1%9E%E5%B1%80%E5%8D%B3%E6%99%82%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%B7%E9%86%AB%E5%81%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%B7%9F%E5%B0%8D%E6%96%B9%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E9%80%A3%E6%8E%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢港怡醫院手機應用程式疑被黑客入侵</a></p><p></p><p></p><p>【私家車寶勒巷剷上行人路釀一死三傷】</p><p></p><p>2026年11月22日，尖沙咀寶勒巷有私家車剷上行人路，一死三人受傷。香港巴基斯坦協會指，死者是協會執行委員會成員，亦是知名商人。涉事私家車男司機被控危險駕駛引致他人死亡等九項罪名，申請保釋被拒。</p><p></p><p>➢<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207753-%E5%AF%B6%E5%8B%92%E5%B7%B7%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%8D%E6%9C%89%E7%89%87%E6%93%9A%E6%82%8938%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E6%A3%84%E8%BB%8A%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E5%BE%8C%E6%B6%89%E5%8D%B1%E9%A7%95%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95%E9%85%92%E7%B2%BE%E6%B8%AC%E8%A9%A6%E8%B6%85%E6%A8%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">有片｜男子棄車逃逸後涉危駕被捕　酒精測試超標</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208117-%E5%AF%B6%E5%8B%92%E5%B7%B7%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%8D38%E6%AD%B2%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E8%A2%AB%E6%8E%A7%E5%8D%B1%E9%9A%AA%E9%A7%95%E9%A7%9B%E7%AD%89%E4%B9%9D%E9%A0%85%E7%BD%AA%E5%90%8D%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B%E4%BF%9D%E9%87%8B%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%92\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢38歲涉事司機被控危險駕駛等九項罪名申請保釋被拒</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207970-%E5%AF%B6%E5%8B%92%E5%B7%B7%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%8D%E6%93%9A%E6%82%89%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E7%82%BA%E7%9F%A5%E5%90%8D%E5%95%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%82%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BB%81%E5%8E%9A%E6%93%81%E6%9C%89%E5%A0%AA%E7%A8%B1%E5%85%B8%E7%AF%84%E5%93%81%E6%A0%BC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">➢據悉死者為巴基斯坦知名商人擁有堪稱典範品格</a></p><p></p><p>➢<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1207794-%E5%AF%B6%E5%8B%92%E5%B7%B7%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%8D%E4%BA%8B%E7%99%BC%E5%89%8D%E7%A7%81%E5%AE%B6%E8%BB%8A%E6%9B%BE%E6%92%9E%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E6%A8%99%E7%A4%BA%E6%9F%B1